sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Dashboard
    participant SC as Stops Controller
    participant CC as Causes Controller
    participant ST as SQL table: stops
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Open monitoring dashboard
    UI-->>Admin: Display default filters
    Admin->>UI: Select date/period and team

    par Load cause reference data
        UI->>CC: Request causes list
        CC->>CA: Read causes
        CA-->>CC: Causes
        CC-->>UI: Causes list
    and Load daily stop analytics
        UI->>SC: Request daily summary
        SC->>ST: Aggregate stops by day/team
        SC->>CA: Read cause TRS flags
        ST-->>SC: Stop totals
        CA-->>SC: Cause flags
        SC-->>UI: Daily summary
    and Load downtime by cause
        UI->>SC: Request downtime by cause
        SC->>ST: Sum downtime by cause
        SC->>CA: Join cause names
        ST-->>SC: Downtime totals
        CA-->>SC: Cause names
        SC-->>UI: Downtime series
    end

    UI-->>Admin: Display overview, KPIs and charts
    alt No data or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show empty state or error message
    end
